    "note": "Chaptered, Public Chapter 467, 2017-05-31 (House Bill 508 substituted for Senate Bill 445; one document). OCR is imperfect in the text file. SECTION 2 (new TCA 29-20 section) removes governmental immunity for suits under 39-17-1314(g)-(i). SECTION 4 quote is the replacement language; the bill deletes \"This section shall not apply to\". SECTION 5 swaps the word \"room\" for \"building\" in 39-17-1306(a); the quote is the instruction sentence."
